   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 3. Products: breadth-first search from the local covectors\nSome local covectors are not CBR. At [2,1,0], site 2 needed ⟨Ω|t₂(θ₂+h)·t₁(θ₂−h). To catch these, every local covector found so far is multiplied by t₁(x) and by t₂(x), for x = θ_s+ch with c = −8..8, and re-tested. This is done to depth 2, i.e. up to two extra factors.\n\nSince t₃ is a c-number and Ω⊗Ω is local on both sites, adding t₃ terms never changes locality, so products cover CBR combinations as well.\n\n**Span.** The span column is the rank of {Ω_zw} ∪ {site-s vectors v} reached at each depth. It measures how much one-site information the data carry. The maximum is d = 15.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "siteVec[Λ_, s_, c_] := With[{C = Partition[c, dim[Λ]], Ω = N[Ω1[Λ]]}, If[s == 1, C . Ω/(Ω . Ω), Ω . C/(Ω . Ω)]];\nlabS = {\"site 1\", \"SITE 2\"};\n(* seeds: the CBR hits; each node = {description, covector} *)\nseeds[Λ_, s_] := Table[{{{\"T\", h[[1]], h[[2]]}}, cbrN[Λ, Ω2N[Λ], h[[1]], thN[[s]] + h[[2]] hN]}, {h, hitsCBR[Λ, s]}];\nbfsStep[Λ_, s_, nodes_] := Flatten[Table[With[{c2 = tApplyN[Λ, nd[[2]], a, thN[[s]] + cc hN]}, If[locLabel[Λ, c2] === labS[[s]], {{Append[nd[[1]], {\"t\", a, cc}], c2}}, {}]], {nd, nodes}, {a, 2}, {cc, cRange}], 3];\nspanRank[Λ_, s_, nodes_] := MatrixRank[Prepend[siteVec[Λ, s, #[[2]]] & /@ nodes, N[Ω1[Λ]]], Tolerance -> 10^-8];\n{bfsT, bfs} = AbsoluteTiming[Association[Table[{Λ, s} -> NestList[bfsStep[Λ, s, #] &, seeds[Λ, s], 2], {Λ, {{2, 1, 0}, {3, 1, 0}}}, {s, 2}]]];\n(* factor lists of the local covectors at each depth; t's commute, so sort to merge orderings (\"t\" sorts before \"T\") *)\nfacs[Λ_, s_, dep_] := Union[Sort /@ bfs[{Λ, s}][[dep + 1]][[All, 1]]];\nbfsSummary = Flatten[Table[{Λ, s, Length /@ bfs[{Λ, s}], spanRank[Λ, s, #] & /@ FoldList[Join, bfs[{Λ, s}]], facs[Λ, s, 1]}, {Λ, {{2, 1, 0}, {3, 1, 0}}}, {s, 2}], 1];\nchecks[\"control [2,1,0] site 2: depth-1 products = t2(θ2+h)·t1(θ2-h) only\"] = facs[{2, 1, 0}, 2, 1] === {{{\"t\", 1, -1}, {\"T\", {1, 1}, 1}}};\nchecks[\"[3,1,0] span ranks {Ω, v}: site 1 = 4, site 2 = 3 (saturated at depth 0/1)\"] = Last[bfsSummary[[3, 4]]] == 4 && Last[bfsSummary[[4, 4]]] == 3;\nGrid[Join[{{\"Λ\", \"site\", \"# local covectors at depth 0,1,2\", \"span rank {Ω, v} (cumulative)\", \"depth-1 products {{t, a, c}, {T, λ, c}}\"}}, bfsSummary, {{\"time (s)\", bfsT}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
