  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Two- and three-t products, scanned unbiased** (cell below; all t_a(x)t_b(y) and t_a(x)t_b(y)t_c(z) with x, y, z ∈ θ_s+ℤh): for [3,1,0], no pure product is local on site 1. That is consistent with T₍₂,₂₎(θ₁−3h) = t₂t₂ − t₁t₃ being a genuine combination, since t₃(θ₁−2h) ≠ 0. On site 2 the only local pair is t₂(θ₂+h)t₁(θ₂−h), and there are no triples.\n\n## 4. Exact confirmation and comparison with the one-site chain\n- **Exact arithmetic.** Each local object found above is recomputed exactly (surds included) with covector–Lax products, C·(ℒ⁽¹⁾⊗ℒ⁽²⁾) = ℒ⁽¹⁾ᵀCℒ⁽²⁾, and locality is tested with `PossibleZeroQ`.\n- **One-site comparison.** The site vector v is compared with the same object on the one-site chain at θ_s with the same twist, w = ⟨Ω_zw|T^{L=1,θ_s}(u). The fit is v = f·w + g·Ω_zw, and f, g are numbers at this one point.\n- **Factoring f.** f is matched against ±∏_k(θ₁₂+kh)^{m_k}·(rational). The factors at this point are θ₁₂+kh = (62+35k)/70, i.e. −43/70, −8/70, 27/70, 62/70, 97/70, 132/70, 167/70 for k = −3..3.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "pairScan[Λ_, s_] := Select[Flatten[Table[If[a == b && y < x, Nothing, With[{c = tApplyN[Λ, tApplyN[Λ, Ω2N[Λ], a, thN[[s]] + x hN], b, thN[[s]] + y hN]}, {a, x, b, y, locLabel[Λ, c]}]], {a, 2}, {x, cRange}, {b, a, 2}, {y, cRange}], 3], #[[5]] === labS[[s]] &];\ntripScan[Λ_, s_, rng_] := Module[{out = {}}, Do[If[(a < b || (a == b && x <= y)) && (b < c || (b == c && y <= z0)), With[{cv = tApplyN[Λ, tApplyN[Λ, tApplyN[Λ, Ω2N[Λ], a, thN[[s]] + x hN], b, thN[[s]] + y hN], c, thN[[s]] + z0 hN]}, If[locLabel[Λ, cv] === labS[[s]], AppendTo[out, {{a, x}, {b, y}, {c, z0}}]]]], {a, 2}, {b, 2}, {c, 2}, {x, rng}, {y, rng}, {z0, rng}]; out];\npairs310 = Table[pairScan[{3, 1, 0}, s][[All, 1 ;; 4]], {s, 2}];\ntrips310 = Table[tripScan[{3, 1, 0}, s, Range[-6, 6]], {s, 2}];\nchecks[\"[3,1,0] pure products: site 1 none; site 2 only t1(θ2-h) t2(θ2+h) (pairs); no triples\"] = pairs310 === {{}, {{1, -1, 2, 1}}} && trips310 === {{}, {}};\n(* exact two-site covector ops (d x d matrices) *)\nLaxX[Λ_, s_, v_] := LaxX[Λ, s, v] = Table[KroneckerDelta[a, b] (v - thN[[s]]) IdentityMatrix[dim[Λ]] + hN EH[Λ][a, b], {a, 3}, {b, 3}];\ncTab[Λ_, C_, a_, l_, v_] := Sum[Transpose[LaxX[Λ, 1, v][[a, k]]] . C . LaxX[Λ, 2, v][[k, l]], {k, 3}];\ntApplyX[Λ_, C_, a_, v_] := Which[C === 0, 0, a == 0, C, a == 3, qdet[Λ][v] C, a < 0 || a > 3, 0, True,\n   Expand[Sum[Sum[Signature[σ] Fold[zN[[#2[[2]]]] cTab[Λ, #1, σ[[#2[[1]]]], #2[[2]], v - (#2[[1]] - 1) hN] &, C, Transpose[{Range[a], I}]], {σ, Permutations[I]}], {I, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}]]];\n(* exact one-site ops at site s (covector w, d-vector), same twist; a = 3 by its own quantum minor *)\nwApplyX[Λ_, s_, w_, a_, v_] := Which[w === 0, 0, a == 0, w, a < 0 || a > 3, 0, True,\n   Expand[Sum[Sum[Signature[σ] Fold[zN[[#2[[2]]]] (#1 . LaxX[Λ, s, v - (#2[[1]] - 1) hN][[σ[[#2[[1]]]], #2[[2]]]]) &, w, Transpose[{Range[a], I}]], {σ, Permutations[I]}], {I, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}]]];\ncbrGen[app_, c0_, λ_, u_] := Module[{lc = conj[λ], n = Max[λ], dp}, dp[0, {}] = c0;\n   dp[k_, S_] := dp[k, S] = Total[Table[With[{a = lc[[j]] + k - j}, If[a < 0 || a > 3, 0, (-1)^Count[S, x_ /; x > j] app[dp[k - 1, DeleteCases[S, j]], a, u + (k - 1) hN]]], {j, S}]]; dp[n, Range[n]]];\n(* an object = list of factors {\"T\", λ, c} or {\"t\", a, c}, evaluated at θ_s + c h *)\nobj2[Λ_, s_, fl_] := Fold[If[#2[[1]] === \"T\", cbrGen[tApplyX[Λ, #1, #2, #3] &, #1, #2[[2]], thN[[s]] + #2[[3]] hN], tApplyX[Λ, #1, #2[[2]], thN[[s]] + #2[[3]] hN]] &, Outer[Times, Ω1[Λ], Ω1[Λ]], fl];\nobj1[Λ_, s_, fl_] := Fold[If[#2[[1]] === \"T\", cbrGen[wApplyX[Λ, s, #1, #2, #3] &, #1, #2[[2]], thN[[s]] + #2[[3]] hN], wApplyX[Λ, s, #1, #2[[2]], thN[[s]] + #2[[3]] hN]] &, Ω1[Λ], fl];\nloc1X[Λ_, C_] := zeroQ[C - Outer[Times, C . Ω1[Λ]/(Ω1[Λ] . Ω1[Λ]), Ω1[Λ]]];\nloc2X[Λ_, C_] := zeroQ[C - Outer[Times, Ω1[Λ], Ω1[Λ] . C/(Ω1[Λ] . Ω1[Λ])]];\nfitFG[v_, w_, Ω_] := Module[{f, g, sol}, sol = Quiet[Solve[Thread[(v - f w - g Ω)[[{1, 2, 3}]] == 0], {f, g}]]; If[sol === {}, {\"no fit\", \"\"}, {f, g} /. First[sol] /. x_ :> RootReduce[x]]];\nobjs310 = {{1, {{\"T\", {1, 1}, -3}}}, {1, {{\"T\", {2, 2}, -3}}}, {1, {{\"T\", {3, 2}, -3}}}, {1, {{\"T\", {2, 2}, -3}, {\"t\", 1, -1}}}, {1, {{\"T\", {3, 2}, -3}, {\"t\", 2, 1}}},\n   {2, {{\"t\", 2, 1}}}, {2, {{\"t\", 2, 1}, {\"t\", 1, -1}}}};\n{exT, exRes} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[Module[{s = ob[[1]], fl = ob[[2]], C, v, w, fg},\n     C = obj2[{3, 1, 0}, s, fl]; w = obj1[{3, 1, 0}, s, fl];\n     v = If[s == 1, C . Ω1[{3, 1, 0}], Ω1[{3, 1, 0}] . C]/(Ω1[{3, 1, 0}] . Ω1[{3, 1, 0}]);\n     fg = fitFG[v, w, Ω1[{3, 1, 0}]];\n     {s, fl, If[s == 1, loc1X[{3, 1, 0}, C], loc2X[{3, 1, 0}, C]], fg[[1]], fg[[2]], If[fg[[1]] === \"no fit\", False, zeroQ[v - fg[[1]] w - fg[[2]] Ω1[{3, 1, 0}]]]}], {ob, objs310}]];\nchecks[\"[3,1,0]: all 7 local objects confirmed exactly\"] = And @@ exRes[[All, 3]];\n(* row 4, T22(θ1-3h)·t1(θ1-h), is local but its site vector is NOT f w + g Ω; it adds nothing to the span (Section 3) *)\nchecks[\"[3,1,0]: site vectors = f (one-site object) + g Ωzw, exactly (all rows but T22·t1)\"] = And @@ Delete[exRes[[All, 6]], 4];\nchecks[\"[3,1,0]: T22(θ1-3h)·t1(θ1-h) site vector is not f w + g Ω (record)\"] = ! exRes[[4, 6]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"site\", \"factors\", \"local (exact)\", \"f\", \"g\", \"v = f w + g Ω exact\"}}, exRes, {{\"time (s)\", exT}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
