  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* reconstruction of every HW-limit eigenstate (<x0|Psi> = 1) at small twist, 20 w, 200 digits: data b = M.Psi stand in for the Q side (exact identity) *)\n{trc, rc310} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[{e, fam, reconP[e, ωMany[[1 ;; 20]], 200, fam]}, {e, {10^-6, 10^-9}}, {fam, {{\"site1\", \"site2\"}, {\"site1\", \"site2\", \"Ω\"}}}]];\nerrOf[r_, sel_] := Max[Select[r, sel][[All, {4, 5}]]];\nchecks[\"[3,1,0] site1+site2: all HW states except [3,3,2] reconstructed (max rel. err, ε=1e-6,1e-9)\"] = Max[Table[errOf[rc310[[k, 1, 3]], #[[1]] != {3, 3, 2} &], {k, 2}]];\nchecks[\"[3,1,0] site1+site2: [3,3,2] NOT reconstructed (rel. err, not a zero test)\"] = Min[Table[errOf[rc310[[k, 1, 3]], #[[1]] == {3, 3, 2} &], {k, 2}]];\nchecks[\"[3,1,0] site1+site2+Ω: all 10 HW states reconstructed (max rel. err)\"] = Max[Table[errOf[rc310[[k, 2, 3]], True &], {k, 2}]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"ε\", \"data\", \"μ\", \"dim\", \"rank (+x0)\", \"rel. error Ψ\", \"rel. error HW part\"}},\n   Flatten[Table[Join[{r[[1]], StringRiffle[r[[2]], \"+\"]}, row], {r, Flatten[rc310, 1]}, {row, r[[3]]}], 1], {{\"time (s)\", trc}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
