   "value": "**Result (Section 5).** Locality holds exactly at ε = 1/3 for all 20 values of w (residual 0 at 80 digits).\n\n**Rank per dominant weight space,** at ε = 1/3 with x₀ included. The ranks are the same for 20 and for 30 values of w.\n\n| sector | dim | site1 | site1+Ω | site2 | site2+Ω | site1+site2 | all |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| (3,3,2) | 18 | 10 | 12 | 7 | 9 | **16** | 18 |\n| (4,2,2) | 14 | 10 | 12 | 7 | 9 | 14 | 14 |\n| (4,3,1) | 10 | 7 | 8 | 5 | 6 | 10 | 10 |\n| (4,4,0) | 3 | 3 | 3 | 2 | 2 | 3 | 3 |\n| (5,2,1) | 6 | 6 | 6 | 5 | 6 | 6 | 6 |\n| (5,3,0), (6,1,1), (6,2,0) | 2, 2, 1 | full | full | full | full | full | full |\n\n**Reconstruction at ε = 10⁻⁶ and 10⁻⁹.**\n- **site1 + site2 + x₀:** **9 of the 10 HW states are exact**, to 10⁻⁸⁶ or better. This includes both [5,2,1] copies and both [4,3,1] copies, so the multiplicity-2 mixing is fixed.\n- **[3,3,2] fails completely** (relative error ≈ 1). Its HW direction lies in the 2-dimensional null space of the site-localized data in the (3,3,2) sector.\n- **Adding the bare overlap ⟨Ω(w)|Ψ⟩:** all 10 are exact, [3,3,2] included (10⁻¹⁰² at ε = 10⁻⁶, 10⁻⁴⁹ at ε = 10⁻⁹).\n\n**Comparison with [2,1,0].** There, site1 + site2 alone already gave everything, singlet scale included. [3,3,2] is the bottom irrep (μ₃ = 2 > λ₂ = 1), the same kind of state the old ν₃ > λ₂ rule flagged. Closing it with localized data alone would need one more site-localized ingredient. None exists among the CBR shapes, products or t\\* at θ_s+ℤh.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Summary of checks\nBoolean checks must be `True`. Numeric residuals must be below 10⁻²⁵, except the machine-precision ones from Section 1, which must be below 10⁻¹¹. Entries marked \"not a zero test\" are sizes, and must be large.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "passQ[k_, v_] := Which[v === True, True, v === False, False, StringContainsQ[k, \"not a zero test\"], v > 10^-3, StringContainsQ[k, \"machine\"], v < 10^-11, NumericQ[v], v < 10^-25, True, False];\nGrid[Prepend[KeyValueMap[{#1, If[NumericQ[#2], ScientificForm[N[#2, 3], 3], #2], If[passQ[#1, #2], Style[\"PASS\", Darker[Green]], Style[\"FAIL\", Red]]} &, checks], {\"check\", \"value\", \"\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
